# Presentation title

Subtitle, speaker and date

---

## A content slide

- A line with three dashes starts a new slide
- An underscore directive in an HTML comment, like `<!-- _class: lead -->`, changes only its own slide
- The `theme:` in the front matter picks the look: default, gaia or uncover

<!--
Presenter notes: an HTML comment that is not a directive, like this one.
-->

---

## Images and backgrounds

- `![w:300](images/photo.png)` scales an image to 300 px wide
- `![bg](images/photo.png)` fills the slide background
- `![bg right:40%](images/photo.png)` puts the image on the right 40 percent

